GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Sample_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Sample_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Sample_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759> ;
    narr:childCount "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "e3c75c2df1a4d6b8ce07850fdf733affe72074b3" ;
    narr:narration """The call opens under [a rejection already returned on the change under review](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_61) and threads back to [the base question of how minimum soak duration between site cutovers gets determined and validated](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_2). [A first review comment proposes naming who signs off the second site before it starts](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_3), grounded in [an account of the earlier pilot's exception queue and the two-week reasoning drawn from it](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_4), which [gets logged as the reasoning of record](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_5) despite [a caution that the evidence behind it is thin](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_6) and [a preference for holding the longer window until evidence justifies shortening it](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_7). [A decision to rule out parallel cutovers](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_10) follows from [a dependency the standing rules were quietly assuming](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_9), after which [a request for early dates and a no-shortening commitment is raised and accepted](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_11). Later in the same thread, [a correction is raised before anything else and asked to be struck from the plan](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_21), tracing [the earlier delay to a now-retired scheduled job rather than the site itself](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_23) — [confirmed gone and superseded by continuous processing](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_28). [A shorter window is reproposed as the soak, with the underlying sequencing left untouched](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_33), though [the new number is named as tight rather than safe](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_43) and [its freed time is routed into a buffer rather than the schedule](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_54). [The shorter figure is then recorded as superseding the earlier note](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_56), and [the change under review is rejected on the ground that this figure is itself still unmeasured](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_62).""" ;
